  "description": "\"OData2Poco is a class library supporting netstandard2,net6 and .NET 4.61+ to generate  plain-old CLR objects (POCO/DTO) from OData feeds that implement both V1-3 and V4 OData protocol,based on the metadata of the service stored on the  server. Code generation is controlled with lot of configuration parameters. POCO/DTO  can be used in typed RESTful client OData services\"",
